  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ttAOcq3.png\" alt=\"Packed Up Banner\" width=\"1903\" height=\"431\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>Packed Up</strong> 能讓你解決物品欄問題，賦予你<strong>合成全新超讚背包</strong>的能力！這將讓你能隨身攜帶物品，而不必到處放置那些令人頭痛的箱子！它也非常適合旅行與探索地牢！背包還可搭配<strong>Baubles</strong>、&nbsp;<strong>Curios </strong>和&nbsp;<strong>Trinkets</strong>，並可透過快捷鍵開啟！</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/OwFkm6a.png\" alt=\"Seperator\" width=\"1903\" height=\"75\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>背包：</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/oMnBXzF.png\" alt=\"Standard Backpack\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;標準背包</strong></h4>\n<p>- 適合<strong>3&nbsp;行</strong>的物品儲存。</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/281/288/310/172/basic_backpack_crafting.png\" alt=\"Recipe for the Standard Backpack\" width=\"310\" height=\"162\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/yu6ubv3.png\" alt=\"Iron Backpack\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;鐵製背包</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>- 由<strong>標準背包</strong>升級</strong></p>\n<p><strong><strong>- 4</strong><strong>&nbsp;行&nbsp;</strong>的儲存空間</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/281/289/iron_backpack_crafting.png\" alt=\"Recipe for the Iron Backpack\" width=\"260\" height=\"136\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Ixnb230.png\" alt=\"Copper Backpack\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;銅製背包</strong></strong></h4>\n<p>- 由&nbsp;<strong>標準背包</strong>升級</p>\n<p>-&nbsp;<strong>4 行&nbsp;</strong>的儲存空間</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/281/290/copper_backpack_crafting.png\" alt=\"Recipe for the Copper Backpack\" width=\"260\" height=\"136\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/aKX00AL.png\" alt=\"Golden Backpack\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;金製背包</strong></h4>\n<p>- 由&nbsp;<strong>鐵製背包&nbsp;</strong>或&nbsp;<strong>銅製背包</strong>升級</p>\n<p>-&nbsp;<strong>5 行&nbsp;</strong>的儲存空間</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/281/291/gold_backpack_crafting.png\" alt=\"Recipe for the Golden Backpack\" width=\"260\" height=\"136\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/281/292/gold_backpack_crafting2.png\" alt=\"Recipe for the Golden Backpack\" width=\"260\" height=\"136\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/0k4GUoC.png\" alt=\"Silver Backpack\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;銀製背包</strong></h4>\n<p>- 由&nbsp;<strong>鐵製背包&nbsp;</strong>或&nbsp;<strong>銅製背包</strong>升級</p>\n<p>-&nbsp;<strong>5 行&nbsp;</strong>的儲存空間</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/281/293/silver_backpack_crafting2.png\" alt=\"Recipe for the Silver Backpack\" width=\"260\" height=\"136\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/281/294/silver_backpack_crafting.png\" alt=\"Recipe for the Silver Backpack\" width=\"260\" height=\"136\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/bSnWiVc.png\" alt=\"Diamond Backpack\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;鑽石背包</strong></h4>\n<p>- 由&nbsp;<strong>金製背包&nbsp;</strong>或&nbsp;<strong>銀製背包</strong>升級</p>\n<p>- <strong>7</strong><strong>&nbsp;行&nbsp;</strong>的儲存空間</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/281/295/310/172/diamond_backpack_crafting.png\" alt=\"Recipe for the Diamond Backpack\" width=\"260\" height=\"136\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/281/296/310/172/diamond_backpack_crafting2.png\" alt=\"Recipe for the Diamond Backpack\" width=\"260\" height=\"136\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Rtk4qvc.png\" alt=\"Obsidian\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;黑曜石背包</strong></h4>\n<p>- 由&nbsp;<strong>鑽石背包</strong>升級</p>\n<p>-&nbsp;<strong>8 行</strong>的儲存空間</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/281/297/310/172/obsidian_backpack_crafting.png\" alt=\"Recipe for the Obsidian Backpack\" width=\"310\" height=\"162\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/OwFkm6a.png\" alt=\"Seperator\" width=\"1903\" height=\"75\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>背包自訂</h2>\n<h5>背包可以擁有自訂名稱與圖示。要自訂背包，只需手持背包時按住 Shift 並點擊右鍵即可。</h5>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/96/customization.webp\" alt=\"Backpack customization\" width=\"400\" height=\"270\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/OwFkm6a.png\" alt=\"Seperator\" width=\"1903\" height=\"75\"></p>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><strong>在背包內開啟另一個背包</strong></h3>\n<h5>1. 點擊右鍵開啟背包</h5>\n<h5>2. 在物品欄中點擊右鍵另一個背包</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/OwFkm6a.png\" alt=\"Seperator\" width=\"1903\" height=\"75\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>常見問題 (FAQ)</strong></h3>\n<h4><strong>此模組會新增銅錠與銀錠嗎？</strong></h4>\n<h5>不會。若要合成銅製與銀製背包，你需要安裝能新增銅錠與銀錠的模組。</h5>\n<h4><strong>我可以變更每個背包的儲存容量嗎？</strong></h4>\n<h5>可以，此設定可在<strong>設定檔</strong>中修改。</h5>\n<h4><strong>我可以將此模組用於我的整合包中嗎？</strong></h4>\n<h5>可以，請隨意將我的模組加入你的整合包中。</h5>\n<h5>&nbsp;</h5>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/OwFkm6a.png\" alt=\"Seperator\" width=\"1903\" height=\"75\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>Discord</strong></h3>\n<h5>想要關注未來內容、新模組開發進度與討論，歡迎加入 SuperMartijn642 的 Discord 伺服器！</h5>\n<h5><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QEbGyUYB2e\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IG1us6p.png\" width=\"373\" height=\"93\"></a></h5>\n<h5>&nbsp;</h5>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/OwFkm6a.png\" alt=\"Seperator\" width=\"1903\" height=\"75\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/281/287/banner.png\" alt=\"All the available backpacks\" width=\"663\" height=\"109\"></p>",
